-### Custom Slash Commands
-Create `.claude/commands/<name>.md` (project-shared) or `~/.claude/commands/<name>.md` (personal):
-
-```markdown
-# .claude/commands/deploy.md
-Run the deploy pipeline:
-1. Run all tests
-2. Build the Docker image
-3. Push to registry
