-## Grid System
-
-### Resolution Presets
-
-```python
-RESOLUTION_PRESETS = {
-    "landscape":  (1920, 1080),  # 16:9 — YouTube, default
-    "portrait":   (1080, 1920),  # 9:16 — TikTok, Reels, Stories
-    "square":     (1080, 1080),  # 1:1  — Instagram feed
-    "ultrawide":  (2560, 1080),  # 21:9 — cinematic
-    "landscape4k":(3840, 2160),  # 16:9 — 4K
