-#### Threshold
-```python
-def sh_threshold(c, thr=128):
-    """Binary black/white at threshold."""
-    gray = c.astype(np.float32).mean(axis=2)
-    out = np.zeros_like(c); out[gray > thr] = 255
-    return out
