-
-### 3D Mobjects
-
-```python
-sphere = Sphere(radius=1).set_color(BLUE).set_opacity(0.7)
-cube = Cube(side_length=2, fill_color=GREEN, fill_opacity=0.5)
-arrow = Arrow3D(start=ORIGIN, end=[2, 1, 1], color=RED)
