-# Animation
-
-## Frame-Based Animation
-
-### The Draw Loop
-
-```javascript
-function draw() {
-  // Called ~60 times/sec by default
-  // frameCount — integer, starts at 1
-  // deltaTime — ms since last frame (use for framerate-independent motion)
-  // millis() — ms since sketch start
-}
