-| Role | Font | Size | Weight | Line Height | Letter Spacing | Notes |
-|------|------|------|--------|-------------|----------------|-------|
-| Display Hero | Cal Sans | 64px | 600 | 1.10 | 0px | Maximum impact, tight default spacing |
