-- **Black** (`#000000`): Primary brand color, text on light surfaces, `--mds-color-hcp-brand`
-- **Dark Charcoal** (`#15181e`): Dark mode backgrounds, hero sections
-- **Near Black** (`#0d0e12`): Deepest dark mode surface, form inputs on dark
