-- Hero Background: Mysteria Purple (`#1b1938`)
-- Primary Text (light bg): Charcoal Ink (`#292827`)
-- Primary Text (dark bg): Translucent White (`color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.95)` — use `rgba(255,255,255,0.95)`)
-- Accent: Lavender Glow (`#cbb7fb`)
