-# GitHub REST API Cheatsheet
-
-Base URL: `https://api.github.com`
-
-All requests need: `-H "Authorization: token $GITHUB_TOKEN"`
-
-Use the `gh-env.sh` helper to set `$GITHUB_TOKEN`, `$GH_OWNER`, `$GH_REPO` automatically:
-```bash
